{"id":1825538,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-14T17:07:34.547Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1825538,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["AR","CO"],"original_language":"es","original_title":"El derecho a invertebrarse","overview":"My live voice activates a projection of images, sounds, quotes and notes from my personal archive.  One day I believed a scientist made spiders dance with a tuning fork, and I recognized something of myself in his determination to catch and feel vibrations before understanding them.  Between what I think I hear and what I imagine, I grope forward in the dark, facing the unknown with no destination other than movement itself, determined to keep inventing possible time lags through sound.  Listening to one’s own listening can be a method of research and creation.  A way of opening ourselves to a new sensibility, of touching the world, of adapting it so that we don’t have to adapt.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/yuIfx88vBN6nlDrvGHXaIYp6tOc.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":45,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Spanish","iso_639_1":"es","name":"Español"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"The Right to Unbone","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2163074,"known_for_department":"Sound","name":"Mercedes Gaviria","original_name":"Mercedes Gaviria","popularity":0.1691,"profile_path":"/FIwmtAp055VVrOuGcpUfjSaxeO.jpg","credit_id":"6af818485537ecb58c641a91","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2163074,"known_for_department":"Sound","name":"Mercedes Gaviria","original_name":"Mercedes Gaviria","popularity":0.1691,"profile_path":"/FIwmtAp055VVrOuGcpUfjSaxeO.jpg","credit_id":"6af8187e1558bd3b666de8ab","department":"Crew","job":"Script"},{"adult":false,